  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1802.28 Facility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1802.28 “Facility” means any institutional, commercial, industrial, residential, public or private building, installation or structure, work place, ship, utility infrastructure, active waste disposal site, inactive asbestos disposal site operated after July 9, 1981, or rental dwelling.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-A 1800) #14104, eff 11-1-24, EXPIRES: 11-1-34",
